# Vendor Comparison Matrix — Infrastructure RFP Q3 FY26

## Summary

Comparative analysis of three vendors evaluated against Acme's IT Infrastructure RFP 2026.

## Evaluation Criteria and Weights

| Criterion              | Weight |
|------------------------|--------|
| Total Cost (5-year)    | 30%    |
| Technical Capabilities | 25%    |
| SLA Terms              | 20%    |
| Security Compliance    | 15%    |
| Migration Support      | 10%    |

## Cost Comparison (5-Year TCO, $M)

| Vendor  | Y1    | Y2    | Y3    | Y4    | Y5    | Total  |
|---------|-------|-------|-------|-------|-------|--------|
| CloudA  | 3.2   | 1.8   | 1.6   | 1.5   | 1.5   | 9.6    |
| CloudB  | 2.9   | 1.7   | 1.5   | 1.4   | 1.4   | 8.9    |
| CloudC  | 3.5   | 2.1   | 1.9   | 1.8   | 1.7   | 11.0   |

## Technical Capabilities Score (out of 10)

| Capability              | CloudA | CloudB | CloudC |
|-------------------------|--------|--------|--------|
| Compute scalability     | 9      | 8      | 9      |
| Storage performance     | 8      | 9      | 7      |
| Networking features     | 8      | 8      | 9      |
| Managed services        | 9      | 7      | 8      |
| Multi-region support    | 9      | 9      | 8      |
| **Weighted avg**        | **8.6**| **8.2**| **8.2**|

## SLA Terms

| SLA Term                   | CloudA      | CloudB      | CloudC      |
|----------------------------|-------------|-------------|-------------|
| Compute uptime             | 99.99%      | 99.95%      | 99.99%      |
| Storage uptime             | 99.999%     | 99.99%      | 99.99%      |
| RTO (outage recovery)      | 15 min      | 30 min      | 15 min      |
| Penalty rate               | 10% monthly | 5% monthly  | 10% monthly |
| SLA audit frequency        | Monthly     | Quarterly   | Monthly     |

## Security Compliance

| Standard        | CloudA   | CloudB   | CloudC   |
|-----------------|----------|----------|----------|
| SOC 2 Type II   | Yes      | Yes      | Yes      |
| ISO 27001       | Yes      | Yes      | No       |
| FedRAMP         | Yes      | No       | Yes      |
| GDPR DPA        | Yes      | Yes      | Yes      |

## Overall Weighted Score

| Vendor  | Cost  | Tech  | SLA   | Security | Migration | Total  |
|---------|-------|-------|-------|----------|-----------|--------|
| CloudA  | 7.5   | 8.6   | 9.0   | 9.5      | 8.0       | **8.4**|
| CloudB  | 8.5   | 8.2   | 7.5   | 8.0      | 8.5       | **8.2**|
| CloudC  | 6.5   | 8.2   | 8.5   | 7.0      | 7.0       | **7.5**|

## Recommendation

CloudA scores highest overall (8.4/10). CloudB is the most cost-effective option and a viable alternative if budget is constrained.
